### Pub System API — quick smoke collection (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
@base = http://localhost:4000/api

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Login (copy accessToken from the response into @token below)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "owner1", "password": "password123" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard KPIs
GET {{base}}/dashboard/kpis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stock recommendations (the decision engine, live)
GET {{base}}/dashboard/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Top drinks by gross profit
GET {{base}}/reports/top-drinks?by=profit&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bottom / slow movers
GET {{base}}/reports/bottom-drinks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sales report + P&L
GET {{base}}/reports/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Products (with live margins)
GET {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ring up a sale (open order → sends to bar)
# @name sale
POST {{base}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }, { "productId": 6, "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Pay that sale (split cash + mobile money)
POST {{base}}/sales/{{sale.response.body.id}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payments": [ { "method": "CASH", "amount": 500 }, { "method": "MOBILE_MONEY", "amount": 800 } ] }

### Replay an offline sale (idempotent: send it twice, it lands once)
# clientRef is minted by the till; soldAt is when it was actually rung up.
POST {{base}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientRef": "5f0c2a8e-3b7d-4c1e-9a2f-6d8b1e4c7a90",
  "soldAt": "2026-09-25T20:15:00Z",
  "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 } ],
  "payments": [ { "method": "CASH", "amount": 1000 } ]
}

### Low-stock alerts
GET {{base}}/dashboard/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
